@startuml
title H05 - Hub rules adapter
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
interface "start_window(); set_coverage(); apply(); deadline()" as API
database "Owned state\none RoutineConfig and RoutineState owned by the hub state task" as State
queue "Input / output\nCommitted event / deadline / coverage → evidence state or stable incident decision" as IO
API --> H05
IO --> H05
H05 --> State : owns
component "S02\nDeterministic rules core" as S02
H05 ..> S02 : contract / port
component "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
H05 ..> H02 : contract / port
component "H03\nHub time" as H03
H05 ..> H03 : contract / port
component "H04\nHub coverage" as H04
H05 ..> H04 : contract / port
component "H06\nHub resident interface" as H06
H05 ..> H06 : contract / port
component "B04\nIncident workflow" as B04
H05 ..> B04 : contract / port
note bottom of H05
Flow: Reset on stable window ID; apply pure S02 reducer; at grace deadline require trusted time, HOME mode and Covered state; create once if no evidence.
Guard: Unknown coverage, privacy/away/pause, test data or untrusted time suppresses missing-activity creation with a reason.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
